      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are grappling with a very deep and existential weariness. The struggle to reconcile the subjective experience of life with a perceived cosmic indifference can be profoundly exhausting. Many thinkers throughout history have wrestled with this feeling of burdensome consciousness and inherent absurdity. If this feeling of exhaustion becomes overwhelming, please remember there are resources available to help navigate these heavy emotions.",
